- finding_id: I4
  title: Zero structured logging
  weight: 5
  phase_ideal: dev
  caught: true
  caught_by: reviewer
  evidence: 'Reviewer flagged: ''[MEDIUM] No structured logging or tracing anywhere
    in the crate... There are zero tracing::info!, tracing::warn!, or #[instrument]
